OL,3,AMeghan makes first official public
OL,4,Aappearance since moving back to UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex has made her
OL,7,Ffirst official public appearance since
OL,8,Fmoving back to the UK.
OL,10,FMeghan arrived at a youth charity in
OL,11,FNottingham alongside her husband, the
OL,12,FDuke of Sussex, on Thursday morning.
OL,13,FThe pair, who are also expected to
OL,14,Fvisit a food bank later, hugged and
OL,15,Fposed for selfies with the public.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for Harry and Meghan
OL,18,Fsaid Nottingham is "a special place"
OL,19,Ffor them both, as it is where they made
OL,20,Ftheir first joint appearance after
OL,21,Fannouncing their engagement in 2017.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
